HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The vviiss(), ssttrrvviiss(), and ssttrrvviissxx() functions first appeared in 4.4BSD.
     The ssvviiss(), ssttrrssvviiss(), and ssttrrssvviissxx() functions appeared in NetBSD 1.5
     and FreeBSD 9.2.  The buffer size limited versions of the functions
     (nnvviiss(), ssttrrnnvviiss(), ssttrrnnvviissxx(), ssnnvviiss(), ssttrrssnnvviiss(), and ssttrrssnnvviissxx()) ap‐
     peared in NetBSD 6.0 and FreeBSD 9.2.  Multibyte character support was
     added in NetBSD 7.0 and FreeBSD 9.2.

